title Cassette: a card with a Mic boost (the FZ-M1 microphone): the Mic boost row after Input level, the total gain under the level, its picker (Off, +10, +20, +30 dB)
sizes 480x320 320x480 640x480
ppmm 608
env CASSETTE_DEMO idle
env CASSETTE_DEMO_BOOST 1
env CASSETTE_LAYOUT_CHECK 1

wait 500
key s
wait 400
expect text "Input level"
expect text "Mic boost"
expect text "Total +15 dB with the Mic boost"
shot settings-boost
expect notext "LAYOUT FAIL"
tap "Mic boost"
wait 300
expect text "+10 dB"
expect text "+30 dB"
shot picker
expect notext "LAYOUT FAIL"
tap "+30 dB"
wait 300
expect text "Mic boost"
say the picker set the Mic boost (setting_choice boost 3)
shot settings-after
expect notext "LAYOUT FAIL"
expect noquit
